The gremlin will multiply into a hoard of them before you reach it.
If it is hostile, wade into the hoard and kill them as you move.  If
it is peacefull, walk through the hoard whenever a space opens in
the direction you wish to go.  In both cases spell/wand of cold
to clear a walking path will help a lot.

Normally, killing peacefull monsters is not a problem for alignment
because there are so few peacefull monsters and so many hostile
ones.  With hoards of cloning gremlins, there can be so many of
them that if you try to kill them all they will take your alignment
down to the point that altar camping might be needed.



